# No generated art

No image generation, no neural texture synthesis, no stock art, no sprite sheets.

Every pixel comes from the renderer. Appearance is numbers in a `.pet.json`, not pixels.

A generated still cannot walk, blink, or track a cursor, and it would be a generic cat. Neural texture synthesis would also need a server, which this project does not have.
